==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ský||cloud|lang=non}} from {{proto|Germanic|skeujam|cloud, cloud cover|lang=is}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|(s)keu-|to cover, conceal|lang=is}}. Cognate with Old English {{term|sc=unicode|sceo|scēo|lang=ang}} (English {{term|sky|lang=en}}) and Faroese {{term|skýggj|lang=fo}}.
